	(text "INTERFACE NOTES\nJ1: Micro-USB 10118194-0001LF. Shield is NC by project review; pin5 remains GND.\nUSB_D+ / USB_D- are the connector-side differential pair; series resistors are on MCU sheet." (at 18 18 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8615cd22-8e76-5d7a-ad94-88e4e8db939b"))

	(text "DAISY CHAIN\nSPI0 input/slave, SPI1 output/master; 1 MHz, Mode 3 (CPOL=1, CPHA=1).\n56-byte frame; 16-bit fields high byte first. Forward only after input trigger.\nHarness mapping: OUT pin k -> IN pin (7-k); verify actual cable orientation.\nJ3 pin2 = SPI1_TX / GPIO15; pin3 = SPI1_RX / GPIO12.\nPower TVS devices are ESD protection; they are not fuses or current limiters." (at 18 145 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2786812a-4fbb-5023-ab9a-dae2db527e88"))
)
